| Java type | Generated deserialization code | Generated serialization code |
|---|---|---|
| `String` | `.asString(null)` | `builder.put(name, instance.field())` |
| `int` | `(int) .asLong(0)` | `builder.put(name, (long) instance.field())` |
| `long` | `.asLong(0)` | `builder.put(name, instance.field())` |
| `double` | `.asDouble(0.0)` | `builder.put(name, instance.field())` |
| `boolean` | `.asBoolean(false)` | `builder.put(name, instance.field())` |
| `BigDecimal` | `.decimalValue()` with null guard | `JqNumber.of(instance.field())` |
| `List<T>` | Loop with recursive mapping | Loop with recursive conversion |
| `Map<String, V>` | forEach with recursive mapping | forEach with recursive conversion |
| `Optional<T>` | Null-check + wrap | Unwrap + convert |
| `JqValue` | Direct passthrough | Direct passthrough |
| `Enum<E>` | `Enum.valueOf(Type.class, .asString(null))` | (truncated in issue body) |

